# Case study reveal timer

Pre-launch case studies can use a **worldwide countdown** (anchored to **IST / Asia/Kolkata**) and blur gate — not per-user `localStorage`.

**Cisco Policy Copilot** is **published** — no email/password gate and not on the IST countdown schedule. Do not re-gate unless the user asks.

## Source of truth

`src/lib/case-study-reveal-schedule.ts`

| Field | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| `mode: "daily-reset"` | Countdown runs until **IST midnight (00:00 Asia/Kolkata)**, then resets. Body **stays blurred** — the timer never unlocks content on its own. |
| `mode: "fixed"` | Legacy one-shot window from `startsAtUtc` + 24 hours. |
| Slug absent from schedule | Case study is **published** for the timer system — may still use an access gate. |

## Access gate (optional / reusable)

| Piece | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Gated slugs | `CASE_STUDY_ACCESS_GATED_SLUGS` in `case-study-password-gate.ts` (currently empty) |
| UI | `CaseStudyPasswordGate` |
| Flow | Email → log via `/api/case-study-access` → press unlock **3 times** |
| Presses | `CASE_STUDY_ACCESS_PRESS_TARGET` (3) |

Add an access gate **only** when the user explicitly asks to gate a case study. Remove it **only** when they say it is ready to publish.

### Publish checklist (access-gated)

1. Remove the slug from `CASE_STUDY_ACCESS_GATED_SLUGS`.
2. Remove `<CaseStudyPasswordGate>` wrapping from the case study component.
3. Update `design.md` (§ Password gate / access gate).

## Daily reset (default for timer drafts)

Do **not** bump `startsAtUtc` manually for `daily-reset` — the countdown resets automatically every IST day.

## Publish only when the user says so

Remove timer or password gates **only** when the user explicitly says the case study is ready to publish, e.g.:

- “this case study is ready”
- “let’s publish this”
- “publish the case study”

### Publish checklist (timer-gated)

1. Remove the slug from `CASE_STUDY_REVEAL_SCHEDULE`.
2. Remove `<CaseStudyRevealCountdown />` from the case study hero `metaBottom`.
3. Remove the `blur-xl` wrapper and `useCaseStudyRevealCountdownForSlug` gate in the case study component.
4. Remove the `⏳` prefix from the title in `src/lib/project-content.ts` if present.
5. Update the schedule table in `design.md` (§ Pre-launch reveal gate).

## Wiring

- Hook: `useCaseStudyRevealCountdownForSlug(slug)`
- UI: `<CaseStudyRevealCountdown slug="your-slug" />` in hero `metaBottom`
- Blur gate: `isRevealed` from the same hook — always `false` while `daily-reset` is active
- Password: `<CaseStudyPasswordGate slug="…" title="…">…</CaseStudyPasswordGate>`

## Do not

- Manually reset `startsAtUtc` for `daily-reset` slugs
- Per-browser countdown (`localStorage`) for the IST timer
- Remove the blur / password gate without an explicit publish request from the user
